{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.colorCubicDiscriminant_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.colorCubicDiscriminant_neg","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive.lean#L76-L81","doc":"**No real branch point**: `Δ(z) < 0` for all real `z`. Consequently the\ntrefoil colour cubic has no real saddle — all 6 branch points are strictly off\nthe real spacetime axis, so the saddle-point orbit is genuinely complex. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.colorCubicDiscriminant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.colorCubicDiscriminant","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive.lean#L73-L74","doc":"The colour-cubic discriminant `Δ(z) = -P(z)` (symbolic-exact result). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.discSextic_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.discSextic_pos","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive.lean#L64-L71","doc":"**Strict positivity on ℝ** (exact SOS certificate): `0 < P(z)` for all real\n`z`. The three `sq_nonneg` hints are the SOS squares. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.discSextic_palindromic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.discSextic_palindromic","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive.lean#L56-L62","doc":"**Palindromic / reciprocal** (`q ↦ q⁻¹` bar-symmetry of the branch locus):\nover a field, for `z ≠ 0`, `z⁶ · P(z⁻¹) = P(z)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.discSextic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.discSextic","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicDiscriminantPositive.lean#L51-L54","doc":"The trefoil colour-cubic discriminant sextic `P(z) = -Δ(z)`, where\n`Δ(z) = disc_X (X³ + (z+1)X² + (z²+z+1)X + (z³+z²+z+1))` (symbolic-exact). ","signatureChunk":0}]}